{
  "date": "2026-11-12",
  "category": "fintech",
  "title_zh": "据报道，京东科技调整架构，成立云科技板块和金融科技板块",
  "title_en": "JD Technology reportedly restructures, setting up a Cloud Technology division and a Financial Technology division",
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "zh": "11月11日，移动支付网等媒体报道，京东科技最近在公司内部宣布调整组织架构，分成“云科技”和“金融科技”两个板块。这个消息来自媒体报道。",
      "en": "On November 11, Mpaypass and other media reported that JD Technology recently announced an internal reorganisation, splitting into two divisions: \"Cloud Technology\" and \"Financial Technology\". This news comes from media reports."
    },
    {
      "zh": "按照报道，云科技会成为京东对外提供技术的主要平台，重点做云计算和人工智能。京东探索研究院的JoyAI和算法团队等也会并入云科技。负责云科技的是徐丰。",
      "en": "According to the reports, Cloud Technology will become JD's main platform for providing technology to outside customers, focusing on cloud computing and artificial intelligence. JoyAI and the algorithm team of the JD Explore Academy, among others, will also be merged into Cloud Technology. Cloud Technology is led by Xu Feng."
    },
    {
      "zh": "金融科技板块负责数字金融业务，包括消费金融、数字支付、财富管理和企业金融。报道说，这个板块的负责人还没有公布。",
      "en": "The Financial Technology division is responsible for digital finance businesses, including consumer finance, digital payments, wealth management and corporate finance. The reports say the head of this division has not yet been announced."
    },
    {
      "zh": "调整以后，这两个板块在京东集团里和京东零售是同一个级别。京东科技以前叫京东金融，2018年改名为京东数科，2021年和京东云等部门合并成了京东科技。",
      "en": "After the change, both divisions will be at the same level as JD Retail within JD Group. JD Technology used to be called JD Finance; it was renamed JD Digits in 2018, and in 2021 it merged with JD Cloud and other units to become JD Technology."
    }
  ],
